SUMMARY:Roddie Romero and The Hub City Allstars
LOCATION:Blue Moon Saloon and Guest House\, 215 East Convent Street\, Lafay
 ette
DESCRIPTION:Straight out of the heart of Acadiana\, Roddie Romero & The Hub
  City Allstars bring the unmistakable sound and spirit of South Louisiana 
 to the stage. Blending traditional Cajun and Creole music with zydeco\, sw
 amp pop\, blues\, funk\, soul\, and rock 'n' roll\, this powerhouse Louisi
 ana band delivers a sound that is as deeply rooted as it is refreshingly o
 riginal.\n\nLed by singer\, songwriter\, accordionist\, and slide guitaris
 t Roddie Romero\, the band celebrates the rich musical heritage of Louisia
 na while pushing its boundaries into exciting new territory. With soulful 
 vocals\, fiery accordion\, masterful guitar work\, and infectious rhythms\
 , their music captures everything that makes South Louisiana special.\n\nA
  three-time Grammy-nominated group\, the Hub City Allstars have spent more
  than two decades performing at prestigious festivals and venues\, earning
  recognition for their musicianship\, original songwriting\, and electrify
 ing live performances. Their critically acclaimed albums\, including The L
 a Louisianne Sessions and Gulfstream \, showcase a band equally comfortabl
 e honoring Louisiana's musical traditions and creating something entirely 
 their own.\n\nhttps://events.timely.fun/kw4jncf1/event/78485755/2026112720
 3000
